@baseUrl = http://localhost:9377

### 1a. 평문 비밀번호 → DB용 인코딩 문자열 (local 프로필 전용)
# @name encodePassword
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/test/password/encode
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "!aest1234!"
}

### 1b. 규칙 위반 예시 (400 예상)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/test/password/encode
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "test1234"
}
